    "The result is not yet confirmed. Check your orders or settings before submitting again.":
        "결과는 아직 확인되지 않았습니다.다시 제출하기 전에 주문이나 설정을 확인하세요.",
    "The saved withdrawal reference cannot be read. Check the original request before submitting again.":
